  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "zcode",
  "requestedModel": "",
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:05:32.823717Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:05:32.823717Z",
  "totalBlocks": 53,
  "translatedBlocks": 53,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f9bcf80aa71bdbe",
      "translationZh": "Notebook：sagemaker/18_inferentia_inference",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9f5155cb65368db",
      "translationZh": "BERT 与 Transformers 的采用持续增长。基于 Transformer 的模型如今不仅在自然语言处理，在计算机视觉、语音和时间序列上也不断取得最先进的性能。💬 🖼 🎤 ⏳",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15c1885e94f4e736",
      "translationZh": "各公司正慢慢从实验研究阶段迈向生产阶段，把 Transformer 模型用于大规模工作负载。但默认情况下，BERT 和它的伙伴们相比传统机器学习算法相当慢、大且复杂。加速 Transformer 与 BERT 是、也将继续是未来值得解决有趣挑战。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64b1da4c553c2ea4",
      "translationZh": "AWS 应对这个挑战的方案是设计一款专为优化推理负载定制的机器学习芯片 AWS Inferentia。AWS 称，相比当前一代基于 GPU 的可比 Amazon EC2 实例，AWS Inferentia“每次推理成本最高降低 80%，吞吐最高提升 2.3 倍”。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d96858af43e2a47",
      "translationZh": "与 GPU 相比，AWS Inferentia 实例的真正价值来自每个设备上的多个 Neuron Core。Neuron Core 是 AWS Inferentia 内部的定制加速器，每颗 Inferentia 芯片带 4 个 Neuron Core。你可以在每个核上加载 1 个模型（追求高吞吐），或在全部核上放 1 个模型（追求低延迟）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c26982b1425da26a",
      "translationZh": "教程",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54eb5ac6cfcd3daa",
      "translationZh": "在这个端到端教程中，你将学到如何用 Hugging Face Transformers、Amazon SageMaker 和 AWS Inferentia 加速文本分类的 BERT 推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58a70857b16ce2c7",
      "translationZh": "Notebook 在这里：sagemaker/18_inferentia_inference",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a315f26064be7c8",
      "translationZh": "你将学到如何：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea3b60bd133602d8",
      "translationZh": "1. 把你的 Hugging Face Transformer 转换为 AWS Neuron 模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca985603b4432d47",
      "translationZh": "2. 为文本分类创建自定义 inference.py 脚本",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a47633fa558b127e",
      "translationZh": "3. 创建 Neuron 模型与推理脚本并上传到 Amazon S3",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e5a7b70958deee1",
      "translationZh": "4. 在 Amazon SageMaker 上部署实时推理端点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "18cd91cec837a176",
      "translationZh": "5. 运行并评估 Inferentia 上 BERT 的推理性能",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3109eb1e1e6cd28",
      "translationZh": "开始吧！🚀",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99292c24ab5c8dca",
      "translationZh": "如果你要在本地环境（非 SageMaker Studio 或 Notebook Instance）使用 SageMaker，你需要访问一个具备 SageMaker 所需权限的 IAM 角色。更多信息见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea3b60bd133602d8",
      "translationZh": "1. 把你的 Hugging Face Transformer 转换为 AWS Neuron 模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c96d21d5a61bba21",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用面向 AWS Inferentia 的 AWS Neuron SDK。Neuron SDK 包含深度学习编译器、运行时和工具，可以把 PyTorch 和 TensorFlow 模型转换、编译成可在 EC2 Inf1 实例上运行的 Neuron 兼容模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "385a27a28649d526",
      "translationZh": "第一步，安装 Neuron SDK 和所需的包。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "736da9d6cb41d009",
      "translationZh": "提示：如果你用的是 Amazon SageMaker Notebook Instance 或 Studio，可以直接用 conda_python3 这个 conda 内核。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d9980cf6ca3ac7",
      "translationZh": "装好 Neuron SDK 后就可以加载并转换模型。Neuron 模型用 torch_neuron 的 trace 方法转换，方式类似 torchscript。更多信息见我们的文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50d2389165a8b64d",
      "translationZh": "要转换模型，先要从 hf.co/models 选定用于文本分类管线的模型。本例我们用 distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english，换成其他 BERT 类模型也很容易。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e15e4093dc196511",
      "translationZh": "撰写本文时，AWS Neuron SDK 尚不支持动态 shape，这意味着编译和推理的输入尺寸必须是静态的。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52db672ae82aa65f",
      "translationZh": "简单说，如果模型编译时用的输入是批大小 1、序列长度 16，那它就只能对相同 shape 的输入跑推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6da653166d94c2a",
      "translationZh": "在 t2.medium 实例上，编译大约需要 3 分钟。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca985603b4432d47",
      "translationZh": "2. 为文本分类创建自定义 inference.py 脚本",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6725a12dd3535162",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Inference Toolkit 基于 🤗 Transformers 的 pipeline 特性支持零代码部署，让用户无需推理脚本即可部署模型 [示例]。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc6f5de6ef8d7f33",
      "translationZh": "目前 AWS Inferentia 尚不支持该特性，这意味着我们需要提供 inference.py 脚本来运行推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5cd6351b06563ac",
      "translationZh": "如果你希望 Inferentia 也支持零代码部署，请在论坛告诉我们。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1dcfcea7671ab22",
      "translationZh": "要使用推理脚本，需要创建 inference.py。本例中，我们将覆盖 model_fn 来加载 Neuron 模型，覆盖 predict_fn 来创建文本分类 pipeline。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9d57ebb74d59354",
      "translationZh": "想了解 inference.py 脚本的更多内容，请看这个示例，其中解释了 model_fn 和 predict_fn 等概念。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e723d14eb213af",
      "translationZh": "我们用 NEURON_RT_NUM_CORES=1 确保每个 HTTP worker 使用 1 个 Neuron 核，以最大化吞吐。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a47633fa558b127e",
      "translationZh": "3. 创建 Neuron 模型与推理脚本并上传到 Amazon S3",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a0458ff4b52795d",
      "translationZh": "把 Neuron 模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker 之前，需要创建 model.tar.gz 压缩包，把全部模型工件存进 tmp/（例如 neuron_model.pt），并上传到 Amazon S3。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29770ac5ea497401",
      "translationZh": "为此需要先配置权限。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5de437fecc53b05",
      "translationZh": "接着创建 model.tar.gz。inference.py 脚本会放进 code/ 文件夹。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e983e4d7716e504b",
      "translationZh": "现在可以用 sagemaker 把 model.tar.gz 上传到本次会话的 S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3e5a7b70958deee1",
      "translationZh": "4. 在 Amazon SageMaker 上部署实时推理端点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1ef403d518e7e7f",
      "translationZh": "把 model.tar.gz 上传到 Amazon S3 后，就能创建自定义 HuggingfaceModel。这个类将用于在 Amazon SageMaker 上创建并部署我们的实时推理端点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "18cd91cec837a176",
      "translationZh": "5. 运行并评估 Inferentia 上 BERT 的推理性能",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "720e9ae6449b11ed",
      "translationZh": ".deploy() 返回一个 HuggingFacePredictor 对象，可用于请求推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f65baaae9d165e8",
      "translationZh": "我们成功把 Neuron 编译的 BERT 部署到了 Amazon SageMaker 的 AWS Inferentia 上。现在测试它的性能。作为简易负载测试，我们循环向端点发送 10,000 个同步请求。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37accb94615db0a9",
      "translationZh": "到 cloudwatch 里看看性能。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86f192f8308c9a5e",
      "translationZh": "序列长度 128 时，我们的 BERT 模型平均延迟为 5-6 毫秒。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f68e7d0116ef6a43",
      "translationZh": "图 1. 模型延迟",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c8d521ada10e61e5",
      "translationZh": "删除模型与端点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08a1ca358c19c5e3",
      "translationZh": "清理时，我们可以删除模型和端点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbc602f7e39f5133",
      "translationZh": "我们成功地把一个原生的 Hugging Face Transformers 模型编译成了 AWS Inferentia 兼容的 Neuron 模型，随后用新的 Hugging Face 推理 DLC 把它部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们做到了每个 Neuron 核 5-6 毫秒的延迟——延迟上优于 CPU；由于 4 个模型并行运行，吞吐也高于 GPU。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d288f23f2bf6ffa5",
      "translationZh": "如果你或你的公司目前正把类 BERT Transformer 用于编码器任务（文本分类、token 分类、问答等），且当前延迟满足要求，就应当切换到 AWS Inferentia。这不仅省钱，还能提升模型的效率和性能。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81656dbf5a522781",
      "translationZh": "我们计划未来做一期关于 Transformer 成本性能的更详细案例研究，敬请期待！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a3f2425b73bd8c3",
      "translationZh": "另外，如果你想进一步了解如何加速 Transformer，也请看看 Hugging Face optimum。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02cd6ff666aad74b",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如有问题，欢迎通过 GitHub 或论坛联系我，也可以在 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 上联系我。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
